%% Sequence — courier updates status, event fans out to notifications (report sequence 3)
%% Based on seq-courier-status.mmd by Thisaru Ramanayaka (Role 6) with Role 4's part; corrected against
%% docs/architecture.md v1.2 §6.2, §6.3 "Who is notified", §10.3
%% Changes: proof photo to MinIO; X-Internal-Token; event published by the outbox relay; all four consumers shown;
%% contacts for customer vs merchant bookings (recipient from parcel-service, not only the customer from auth-service).
%% parcel_db, the outbox relay and the SSE tracking service are shown inside parcel-service to keep it readable.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Courier
    participant GW as api-gateway :8080
    participant DS as dispatch-service :8084
    participant S3 as MinIO
    participant PS as parcel-service :8083
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NS as notification-service :8086
    participant AUTH as auth-service
    participant OUT as Email / SMS / webhook

    Courier->>GW: POST /api/v1/courier/deliveries/{id}/status<br/>Bearer JWT · {status, note, failureReason?, photo?}
    GW->>DS: forward after JWT check (JWKS)
    DS->>DS: @PreAuthorize COURIER, load assignment
    alt assignment belongs to another courier
        DS-->>Courier: 403 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    end
    opt photo attached
        DS->>S3: PUT delivery-proofs/{parcelId}/{uuid}.jpg
        DS->>DS: save delivery_proofs row
    end
    DS->>PS: PATCH /internal/parcels/{id}/status · X-Internal-Token
    PS->>PS: lock row, ParcelStateMachine checks the move
    alt transition not allowed
        PS-->>DS: 409 Conflict
        DS-->>Courier: 409 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    else FAILED without a reason
        PS-->>DS: 400
        DS-->>Courier: 400 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    else allowed
        Note over PS: one transaction:<br/>status, history row,<br/>outbox event
        PS-->>DS: 200
        DS-->>Courier: 200 status updated (via GW)
    end

    Note over PS,MQ: asynchronous, about 1 s later
    PS->>MQ: OutboxRelay publishes ParcelStatusChanged<br/>parcel.status.out_for_delivery (IDs only)

    par notification.q
        MQ-)NS: event (skip if eventId already processed)
        alt customer booking
            NS->>AUTH: GET /internal/users/{customerId}/contact
            NS->>OUT: email to the customer
        else merchant booking
            NS->>PS: GET /internal/parcels/{id}/contacts
            NS->>OUT: email to the recipient
        end
        opt OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DELIVERED or FAILED
            NS->>PS: GET /internal/parcels/{id}/contacts
            NS->>OUT: SMS to the recipient
        end
    and webhook.q
        MQ-)NS: event
        opt merchantId set
            NS->>OUT: HMAC-signed POST to merchant webhook<br/>(URL and secret from merchant-service), retried
        end
    and dispatch.q
        MQ-)DS: event, update daily_stats counters
    and tracking.q
        MQ-)PS: event, push STATUS_CHANGE to open SSE pages
    end
